{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/quillmark","sessionId":"insight-17","version":"2.0.17","gitBranch":"fix/print-bleed","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"The print shop sent back the brochure we rendered with Quillmark. Where the background colour should run to the edge of the page there are thin white lines after cutting, and their preflight report says: 'Page 1-12: TrimBox not set or equal to MediaBox. Objects touch the trim edge with no bleed.' What do we need to change?"},"uuid":"80b530e6-2156-43e6-8285-10618784c8af","timestamp":"2026-09-29T08:44:16.000Z"}
